  "conclusion": "corresponds",
  "rationale": "Step.local wraps one inherited Unpacking.Step and advances only the active body. call requires member declaration, destination/result shape, pre-evaluation freshness, EvalArgs, and equal arity; its target retains the evaluated heap/counter, installs the parameter store, and pushes the evaluated caller store with continuation/destination. return evaluates the optional result, delivers it to the saved caller, retains the residual evaluated callee store as inactive and resumes that caller. The displayed three rules include the same premises and state updates. Argument/results are scoped pending values, not an asserted completed frame-realization theorem. The notation and scope were checked against functions.signatures/functions.calls where included and the listed inherited unit inputs; explicit inherited forward references are intentional chapter organization.",
